id: spiritual-leadership
name: Spiritual Leadership
talentCategory: racial
race: yardrat
prerequisites: Yardrat, Master of Minions Talent
description: >
  Though you may take command, you still offer support to those who follow you.
text: >
  Spiritual Leadership: Though you may take command, you still offer support to those who follow you.
  –Prerequisites: Yardrat, Master of Minions Talent
  (1)-[Passive]: You may apply the 4th effect of Power of the Weak if you give Ki Points to a Minion through the Empower Maneuver.
  (2)-[Passive]: While you are Bonded to one of your Minions, they do not skip their Act Phase.
  (3)-[Passive]: All of your Minions have their Maximum Life Points increased by 2 for each Power Level reached (after all calculations).

---

[passive]
# (1) Power of the Weak (4) on an Ally marked a Minion (conditions.mjs bondOpen).
allow leadership.bondMinion;
# Not built: (2), (3) - Minions, their Act Phase and whose they are, wait on the user's design.
